<title>JAPAN: FOREIGNERS NEUTRAL ON JAPAN STOCKS.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NEUTRAL ON JAPAN STOCKS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors via three of Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Tuesday showed a net neutral stance, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 3.5 million shares of sell orders against a similar number of buys.</p>
</text>
